## Claude Code

- Subagents `Explore`, `implementer`, `reviewer`, `ci-fixer` (reports ≤ 15 lines); if `.claude/agents/`
  lacks them: `splice channel add gh:keelstackhq/hull//rigging --piece claude`.
- Skills: `verify`, `add-piece`{% if "docs" in pieces %}, `docs-lookup`{% endif %}. `/loop` runs `.claude/loop.md`.
- Hooks: `guard.mjs` denies publish, force and tag pushes and secret reads, and asks before editing
  template-owned files; `stop-checks.sh` is opt-in (`HULL_STOP_CHECKS=1`).
